Privacy Policy – JobStack

Last updated: 3 March 2026

JobStack is a business productivity application designed for managing clients, jobs, time tracking, materials, and invoices.

1. Data Storage

JobStack stores all data locally on the user’s device. This includes:

Client information

Job details

Time tracking records

Material and cost information

Generated quotes and invoices

Photos and scanned receipts

JobStack does not transmit user data to any external servers.

2. No Data Collection

JobStack does not collect, store, or process personal data outside of the user’s device.

3. No Data Sharing

JobStack does not sell, rent, share, or transfer user data to third parties.

4. Permissions

JobStack may request access to:

Camera (for job photos and receipt scanning)

File storage (for saving PDFs and backups)

Notifications (to do lists and calendar)

These permissions are used solely to provide core app functionality.

5. Backups

Users may export backups manually. These backups remain under the user's control and are not uploaded by JobStack.

6. Security

All data remains stored locally on the device. If encrypted backup features are used, encryption is performed locally.

7. Children

JobStack is not intended for use by children under the age of 13.

